        "original_id": "08db964a-ffb6-503f-aa18-c60558ad8a34",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Homer Simpson, Principal Skinner, Selma, Patty, Hans Moleman, Harry Shearer, Matt Groening, Dan Castellaneta\n- Works: The Simpsons, Principal Charming\n- Roles: fictional characters, voice actors, series creator\n\nFacts:\n- In the episode \"Principal Charming\" of The Simpsons, Homer Simpson invites Principal Skinner to dinner.\n- In the episode \"Principal Charming\" of The Simpsons, Principal Skinner falls for Patty instead of her twin sister Selma.\n- Principal W. Seymour Skinner, born Armin Tamzarian, is a fictional character in the American animated sitcom The Simpsons.\n- Harry Shearer voices Principal Skinner in The Simpsons.\n- Hans Moleman is a character in The Simpsons who was created by series creator Matt Groening.\n- Dan Castellaneta voices Hans Moleman.\n- Hans Moleman first appeared in the episode \"Principal Charming\".",
